WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.620
I had a great shot, blue skies, totally clear.

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:07.240
I tilted up just as the GoPro on the drone tilted down,

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:12.560
And I saw the red light blinking, which immediately told me it's recording.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:18.160
And there's a chip in that camera. But what I didn't know is: Is the drone operator,

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:22.320
some worthless little pervert within a mile of me, looking at a monitor,

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.020
Is he recording it there as well?

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:28.500
And this all goes through the reptilian part of your brain very very quickly, you know?

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.500
But all you can really think of is:

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:37.680
If I pull that trigger and revel in the satisfying tinkle of cheap plastic falling down onto the deck,

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:41.340
is all of it going to pop up on the internet, you know, moments later?

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.260
Hi I'm Nick Gillespie with Reason TV and we
are sitting down with Mike Rowe

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:51.800
