00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:14.430
'Mike Rowe Dead' What uh why were you naked
and how did that lead to you being dead?

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:17.140
Well it's a big week.

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:22.680
I was uh in the midst of what I thought was
some bizarre gardening dream and in the dream

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:26.060
uh a bumblebee was in my ear.

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:31.680
And when I awakened I realized A: It wasn't
a dream and B: It wasn't a bee.

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:35.910
But there was a buzzing sound and it was coming
from the other side of my bedroom window and

00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:40.450
I leapt from the bed in what I described as
my favorite pair of imaginary pajamas.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:45.820
And I pulled the drapes aside and there was
a camera hovering, not in mid air, but from

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:50.380
the belly of a drone and the drone was making
this horrible buzzing sound.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:56.440
And I was standing there in my horrible nakedness
not fully awake but sentient enough to know

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:58.670
that something had to be done.

00:01:58.670 --> 00:02:03.570
So I retreated to the uh bed, pulled the Mossberg
500 from underneath.

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:06.869
And, by the way, do you get a uh is that a
product placement?

00:02:06.869 --> 00:02:07.389
It's not.

00:02:07.389 --> 00:02:10.860
I just like the way I feel when I say Mossberg
500.

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:12.110
It's a great shotgun.

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:16.110
I keep it locked and loaded and the familiar
chunk-chunk is very gratifying.

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:17.540
Now, this is in San Francisco

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:18.080
It is.

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:21.040
So is that legal to have a locked and loaded
shotgun?

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:23.340
It's it's it's it's hard to know.

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:26.880
Uh but uh probably not.

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:29.940
So, now you're naked with a shotgun.

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:30.760
And the drone.

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:32.600
So, so technically not naked.

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:38.200
Clothed in the security that can only come
