00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:30.340
So somebody whose workin' that thing that's
a job that uh, you know, they have so.

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:31.100
Sure.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:35.860
Look I, I think the reason that goofy little
