00:10:48.829 --> 00:10:53.580
Dirty Jobs was about me finding those people,
because I believe you should know them.

00:10:53.589 --> 00:10:57.140
Somebody's Gotta Do it was slightly different.

00:10:57.140 --> 00:11:03.040
That was a show about people who I think you
