00:11:12.621 --> 00:11:17.220
and they're doing a thing because they're compelled to do it.

00:11:17.220 --> 00:11:20.640
And those people I think are interesting for
a slightly different reason.

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:22.420
And these are healthy obsessions, right?

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:22.920
That's right.

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:25.779
I mean this is you- It's not the psycho killer.

00:11:25.779 --> 00:11:27.959
Maybe that's season fifteen is serial killers-

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:29.360
We're saving that for sweeps.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:33.560
Serial killers you should have over for dinner.

00:11:34.579 --> 00:11:39.290
uhm What has happened, like, have we become
so disconnected whether it's from people who

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:43.279
have, you know, a kind of compulsion or a
healthy obsession of 'I wanna do this.

00:11:43.279 --> 00:11:45.170
This is my passion project.

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:50.880
Or the people who do work, the hidden work,
that makes civilization fun and nice and clean

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:53.620
and- and just wonderful.

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:59.520
Have we lost touch with that in our society
and if we have in these uh these two dimensions,

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:00.820
what- what's the cause of that?

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:08.269
I think the irony of the current level of
disconnectedness uh is directly the result

00:12:08.269 --> 00:12:10.520
of the current level of connectedness.

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:15.500
I think, for the first time in history, you
and I are walking around with the,

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.640
with a&nbsp;network in our pockets, you know?

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:19.920
It's not a phone or a camera.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:25.100
It's a network, we can broadcast, we can-
we we're more connected today

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:30.660
than we ever have been in what feels to me like a superficial way.

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:35.100
But at the same time, if there was some sort
of graph that would indicate this I think

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:40.550
we would see a growing disconnect between
the average person and an understanding of

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:42.700
where our food comes from.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:44.430
Where our energy comes from.

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:46.750
And I know with food you've talked about this.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:51.310
It's something like one percent or one and
