00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:47.030
That level of disappointment...

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:52.900
So uh the robe from Donald Trump, you got
16 thousand 500 dollars for.

00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:54.530
There's no accounting for taste.

00:21:54.530 --> 00:22:00.261
Yeah uhm what happened was I announced the
