00:23:15.419 --> 00:23:17.490
and he wasn't gonna get in his own way.

00:23:17.490 --> 00:23:22.170
So he sent me the robe, I put the robe on,
probably lost a million friends because there

00:23:22.170 --> 00:23:23.990
I am wearing Donald's robe.

00:23:23.990 --> 00:23:25.320
